    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe1 <strong>Decorate Your Room</strong> \u2013 Arrange furniture and d\u00e9cor to create a cozy, harmonious space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633420/extras/68d77c66d7fa304c3297c0e66f6eedd6.poster.avif?t=1750646260\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633420/extras/68d77c66d7fa304c3297c0e66f6eedd6.webm?t=1750646260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633420/extras/68d77c66d7fa304c3297c0e66f6eedd6.mp4?t=1750646260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude91 <strong>Mindful Placement</strong> \u2013 Strategically fit each item within the limited space\u2014no clutter allowed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc31 <strong>Cat Guardian</strong> \u2013 Every room needs a feline friend to watch over your cozy haven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633420/extras/7434c126f27ca47cb3812161a8e509ab.poster.avif?t=1750646260\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633420/extras/7434c126f27ca47cb3812161a8e509ab.webm?t=1750646260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633420/extras/7434c126f27ca47cb3812161a8e509ab.mp4?t=1750646260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>A Touch of Light</strong> \u2013 Add warm, ambient lighting to bring your final room to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633420/extras/7e3e53f8b99a62829dce3217bd655f90.poster.avif?t=1750646260\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633420/extras/7e3e53f8b99a62829dce3217bd655f90.webm?t=1750646260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633420/extras/7e3e53f8b99a62829dce3217bd655f90.mp4?t=1750646260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peaceful puzzle experience where simplicity meets creativity. \u2728</p>",
